{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a70db18f3ec34184fc50f9ad28bbfb7dce055d276e004c8950bb5cc5cf4ddeec", "ja": "（オフを利用し、劇場のアイドル達と海へ行ってきた。\nみんなも楽しかったみたいだ……）", "zh": "（趁着休息日，和剧场的偶像们一起去海边了。大家好像也玩得很开心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "04ec3bed2e7bb7d33507cf5076224efed23265817191616d47c3902e211525af", "ja": "ねえねえ、{$P$}さん！　わたし\n沖縄とかいいな～って思うんですけど、どうですか？", "zh": "呐呐，{$P$}先生！我觉得去冲绳之类的地方也不错～你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1002_p", "source_sha256": "176515718686eee5e9288d31b7480318995ce874d9f1e02981b48a653230a1d0", "ja": "ん？　沖縄……？\n一体、何の話だ？", "zh": "嗯？冲绳……？\n到底是在说什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "864936fffddd3581803ca0fa3eebc06778e9063443ee45809559c7e3a030d513", "ja": "え、忘れちゃったんですか！？　今度、ふたりで\n海へ遊びに行くって約束したじゃないですか～！", "zh": "诶，您忘了吗！？我们不是约好了下次两个人一起去海边玩吗～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1004_016tsu", "source_sha256": "cf7f7aaa5172eaa64e5f0499cc5954a272db6a5a7273e64849e2c4e0cdd32d1a", "ja": "ほら、この前みんなで海に行った時ですよ！\nクルーザーの上で、綺麗な夕日を見ながら……。", "zh": "你看，就是之前大家一起去海边的时候呀！  \n在游艇上，一边欣赏美丽的夕阳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1005_p", "source_sha256": "eacccdf4d1e4f470d194fe7d39e7bc4c48672162c902d7ada53952daa73d0c43", "ja": "えっと……確かにクルーザーには乗ったけど。\nあの時、翼は疲れて寝てただろう？", "zh": "呃……确实是坐了游艇。不过那时候，翼不是累得睡着了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "3ea0b9e379111a92fcebe9cbafc410c6365fb094fee5c4229a165faf1e004c67", "ja": "でもわたし、途中で起きましたよ？　その後で、\n景色をみながら、ふたりきりでお話して……。", "zh": "可是我中途醒过来了呀？之后我们还一边看着风景，一边两个人单独聊天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1007_p", "source_sha256": "e00a6d68213182aa143524a7ba4523166202cd2bb2a44f8b7feb035dc9cee58b", "ja": "ふたりきり？\nいや、船には他のみんなもいたけど……。", "zh": "只有我们两个人？\n不对，船上还有其他人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1008_016tsu", "source_sha256": "53e27b00629bd289af8ab09a89d979b276322b2f43501deddeb71d854f117423", "ja": "え？　……え～っ！　じゃあ、あの時の思い出は……\nぜんぶわたしの夢～！？", "zh": "诶？……诶——！那样的话，当时的回忆……\n全都是我的梦～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1009_016tsu", "source_sha256": "6551d4ef0e137c9c6b867ac7210e73b37bd45020a7162521fc8f3e2a1ab71d6d", "ja": "そんな～……。夢みたいって感激したのに、\n本当に夢だったなんて……。", "zh": "怎么会这样～……明明因为像梦一样而感动，没想到竟然真的只是一场梦……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0a1785ba6db3b41114c8b422897f73ddf05c1f1ae8119b390f3f022ccc31c86c", "ja": "はははっ、そうみたいだな……。", "zh": "哈哈哈，看来是这样啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1011_016tsu", "source_sha256": "101f2c0c228cb6cb6f787def57a16ac80fe044b110eb36e49e167aa08ccb3a65", "ja": "せっかく、大人っぽいデートができるって\n楽しみにしてたのに～。", "zh": "难得能来一次成熟风格的约会，\n我还一直期待着呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1012_016tsu", "source_sha256": "29dfe719cc871a90cebdb6da108dd39c0af3b4159bd7f1010d042ffc0a498468", "ja": "あの時の{$P$}さん、すっごく\n優しくて……。まるでカップルみたいだなって……♪", "zh": "那时的{$P$}先生特别温柔……\n简直就像是一对情侣一样呢……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1013_p", "source_sha256": "51dab17dcf83c08f424c5bcf824a1b88a351e15c2d4efbd6bf412b9aa1cc9081", "ja": "それは本当に夢だな……。", "zh": "那真的是梦寐以求啊……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "c075d8c1ecce407133590c8504d5ad1ccb9d5f68602c20a9064b2cda5e45e2db", "ja": "はあ～。今日はヤル気が無くなっちゃいました……。", "zh": "唉～今天完全提不起干劲了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1015_p", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1016_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b6834c880eb60eb28b4cf6351b724404f9c065996db6f6efb452207596a3aa06", "ja": "でも、{$P$}さんと遊びに行ったら\n元気になるかも。……ね、どこか行きましょうよ～♪", "zh": "不过，要是和{$P$}先生一起出去玩，说不定就能打起精神来。……我们去什么地方吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_016tsu0583_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_016tsu0583_1017_p", "source_sha256": "552ed3799339d321de62dc30a72901329b424417cd3d703cee38739ea40a2f23", "ja": "（その後……翼と話し合って、近くのお店でアイスを\n食べた。なんとか翼のヤル気が戻ってよかった……）", "zh": "（那之后……我和翼谈了谈，在附近的店里吃了冰淇淋。幸好总算让翼恢复干劲了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
